### Test Simple SLA Endpoints
### Probar si los endpoints de SLA responden

### 1. Test básico - Obtener configuraciones SLA
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sla
Accept: application/json

### 2. Test configuraciones activas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sla/activas
Accept: application/json

### 3. Test estadísticas SLA
GET http://localhost:8080/api/sla/estadisticas
Accept: application/json

### 4. Test endpoint dashboard SLA
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/sla-analysis
Accept: application/json

